  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the reported figure, there is a cyclic process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;on a sample of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> mol of a diatomic gas. The temperature of the gas during the process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>B</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>D</mi></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;respectively.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d41690be-d8fb-41c8-a0b0-7f3cbdb21800-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 239px;\" /></p><p>Choose the correct option out of the following for work done if processes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></math> are adiabatic.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
